<h2 class="wsite-content-title" style="text-align:justify;"><strong></strong>&#8203;<strong><font size="5">Dynamic Collision Repair is a family owned and operated auto body shop that has been serving the needs of Utah County for over 40 years! We offer quality, guaranteed repairs with customer service that stands above our competitors.<br /><br />Whether it's just a little fender bender, or a major repair from a traffic accident, we can help make your car look good as new again! We work with all insurance companies (regardless of what they try to tell you) and even have &ldquo;Deductible Discount&rdquo; programs that can help you afford those annoying deductible costs.<br /><br />So give us a call today, or just stop in anytime during our business hours for a Free Estimate and let us show you just how much we care about our customers!</font></strong><br /><br /></h2>
